      "derivation": "A tanker (300 M, 100 M/year) needs three Passagem de Ano crossings to break even. The booklet scales petroleiro cards 1-5 with player count and permits the optional second Passagem de Ano at 4 players or fewer - exactly where a tanker is marginal. A mean move of 5 over a 48-cell track and 10 turns per player reproduces that: 1.6, 2.9, 4.0, 4.9, 5.9 years at 2-6 players. A higher mean would make the booklet's own rule pointless.",
      "note": "The physical deck is 60 cards; move values are fixed per printed card and the per-player-count deck is a spread subset, so the mean holds at every player count."
